- **Alpha dependence:** test NDCG@10 averaged over normalisers: fixed 0.8998, Q 0.8996, QS 0.9016, S 0.9003 -> best `QS`.
- **Adaptive vs best fixed (same normaliser, paired bootstrap, test NDCG@10):** 2/3 adaptive configs significantly better, 1 significantly worse. `minmax_Q_listwise_lam0.01` -0.0002 [-0.0003, -0.0001] p=0.0082; `minmax_QS_listwise_lam0.01` +0.0018 [+0.0006, +0.0031] p=0.0054; `minmax_S_listwise_lam0.01` +0.0006 [+0.0001, +0.0010] p=0.0242
- **Oracle headroom (test, oracle minus best fixed, UPPER BOUND):** minmax +0.0336
- **CE over-confidence caveat:** mean top1-top2 logit gap train 0.740 vs dev 0.792.

